WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:01.720
I

00:01.800 --> 00:03.467
Did I really hurt you?

00:06.320 --> 00:07.720
What?

00:08.320 --> 00:09.720
Can't I read?

00:10.760 --> 00:12.320
What I mean is

00:12.520 --> 00:13.480
Reading documents

00:13.560 --> 00:15.893
Should be done where documents are read

00:19.040 --> 00:20.440
You raised this orchid?

00:24.280 --> 00:26.040
This flower was raised by Yu'er

00:26.120 --> 00:28.640
Said to be the king among all flowers

00:28.720 --> 00:31.320
Wants to wait until it blooms before giving it to you

00:31.400 --> 00:32.880
Daughters are good

00:34.000 --> 00:35.400
Daughters are thoughtful

00:37.720 --> 00:39.280
Many rare seeds have arrived from the south

00:39.360 --> 00:40.080
Have Yu'er

00:40.160 --> 00:41.560
Pick what she likes

00:45.240 --> 00:46.320
Father

00:46.400 --> 00:48.067
Dug canals all his life

00:48.840 --> 00:50.507
Truly wasted people and resources

00:51.880 --> 00:53.320
Now the canals are open

00:53.400 --> 00:55.400
Transporting military supplies back and forth

00:55.520 --> 00:56.880
Is greatly convenient

00:58.160 --> 01:00.827
You say, what a coincidence in the world

01:01.640 --> 01:03.000
I sometimes wonder

01:03.880 --> 01:05.280
Father digging canals

01:05.880 --> 01:08.880
Might not just be for lychees and jade powder

01:09.520 --> 01:11.160
No matter what Father thought

01:11.520 --> 01:13.680
When Your Majesty goes north in the future

01:13.760 --> 01:16.760
If it can be of great use, that's good

01:20.240 --> 01:21.040
Your Majesty

01:21.120 --> 01:22.787
Lady Chen requests an audience

01:23.520 --> 01:25.040
How does she know I'm here?

01:25.120 --> 01:26.520
You told her

01:27.240 --> 01:28.640
This

01:28.720 --> 01:30.600
The lady sent someone to ask this servant

01:30.760 --> 01:32.680
This servant dared not refuse to answer

01:32.760 --> 01:34.160
Let her in

01:34.360 --> 01:35.760
Yes

01:46.000 --> 01:47.400
Greetings, Lady Chen

01:49.640 --> 01:51.040
Your Majesty

01:51.240 --> 01:53.680
I heard a mad horse startled Your Majesty

01:53.760 --> 01:55.160
Was very worried

01:55.240 --> 01:57.680
Seeing Your Majesty safe here with my sister

01:57.760 --> 01:59.160
I am relieved

